Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bunch of losers !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:04.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the disciples in the capital were killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:07.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,How will I explain this to the Master ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:12.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Was the Spirit Vein of the capital affected ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.48,0:02:15.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,No Sect Leader, everything is normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:20.73,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(839,505)\fad(300,300)}Wu Cunsu\NTiandao Sect Leader\NEarly stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:17.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,We won't make a fuss about this then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:23.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go tell the Master I request a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:25.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have something to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sect Leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,since we are in the Tiandao Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:35.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,shouldn't you ask him to meet you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:38.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's just a Teng Family branch member.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:39.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shut up !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:42.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't bring this matter ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:44.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the Master hears about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:46.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't save your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:08.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:12.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sit down, sit down !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:21.68,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(447,553)\fad(300,300)}Teng Xuan\NBranch of the Teng Family\NEarly stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.20,0:03:24.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:28.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wu Cunsu,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,is an old dog obedient because it's old
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:33.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,or is it old because it's obedient ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:38.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't think your Ancestors understood this concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:42.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.68,0:03:46.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Tiandao Sect is under your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,How's it going in the capital ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.68,0:03:54.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,A few disciples were hurt by a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:55.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's nothing serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do not worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:10.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't care how many of your disciples are hurt or dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:13.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if something happens to what you're protecting...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Teng Family
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,won't hesitate to replace you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.16,0:04:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:24.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the capital to catch the criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.19,0:04:26.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tiandao Sect Leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:27.71,Second,,0,0,0,,What's going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:29.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.24,0:05:20.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's Early stage Nascent Soul, like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.56,0:05:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,But he broke the formation in one move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:24.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not anger him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:26.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:28.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,how did I offend you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:31.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did you attack the formation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:34.12,Teng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(842,410)}Teng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:33.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wu Cunsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:39.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bold of you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,to trespass on the Teng Family's territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:43.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.87,0:05:45.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and refine his Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:48.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Teng Family is able to control the Tiandao Sect...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.68,0:05:50.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,The country of Zhao really has changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:53.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the Spirit Roots,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,can't be to just feed this Core Formation Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:05:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:00.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you won't kill him,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,someone else will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:05.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they will also deal with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:07.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Useless Sect Leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wu Cunsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.56,0:06:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't forget who the country of Zhao belongs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:17.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:20.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Tiandao Sect is not a place for you to run rampant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:21.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will die for it !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:36.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,He killed Wu Cunsu in one move...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:49.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:50.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of cultivation does he have ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.04,0:07:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:03.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the secret plan of the Teng Family ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let go of me !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you touch me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:11.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Ancestor, Teng Huayuan, won't let you live !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's very protective.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:16.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:20.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you dare to hurt me, he'll tear you apart !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,am lucky to have met you !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.37,0:07:28.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please spare my life !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:33.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:35.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is a map of all the Spirit Veins in Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.84,0:07:37.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,These veins were built by the Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.68,0:07:39.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are used to extract Spirit Roots of mortals
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:40.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,to feed the Teng Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:43.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This thing is actually hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:45.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,underneath the country of Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:50.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Spirit Vein is located at the bottom of the mountain gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:53.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,The disciples of Tiandao Sect usually take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:54.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Senior wants to see it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:38.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is indeed the Spirit Roots of mortals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:42.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,They use the mortals of a country to raise the Teng Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:44.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're down to using such cruel methods
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:50.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,for your own benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.16,0:08:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did you extract the Spirit Roots from the mortals ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Liguo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:09.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You defy my Master like that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:12.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must have a death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:29.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:30.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, let me talk !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.56,0:09:31.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me talk !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:33.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I haven't eaten enough yet !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are such an ungrateful guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each sect that guards a Spirit Vein
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:09:57.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,has a formation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:10:01.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,to absorb the Spirit Roots of mortals
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:05.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,and transport them through the Veins to feed the Teng Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.60,0:10:17.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will pay you back a hundredfold
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:20.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,until you wish you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:25.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who's this person you're trying to call here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old Man Ji Mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.24,0:10:33.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's meet him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:37.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Immortal Ji Mo is here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:40.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,everybody make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:43.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,This flower carriage...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:45.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's really Immortal Ji Mo !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:00.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Immortal Ji Mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:03.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,you said you'd give me a treasure to increase my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.96,0:11:05.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was already 3 days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:07.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You didn't forget did you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:08.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:09.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1525,537)\fad(300,000)}Old man Ji Mo\NTeng  Family Guest Elder\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:11.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:15.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Zhao, there is nothing that I, Immortal Ji Mo, cannot do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:17.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forget about the treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:19.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's kill a few Foundation Establishments brats
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.56,0:11:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you can use their blood
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,to replenish your vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:24.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a great idea ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.24,0:11:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Immortal Ji Mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,is this something urgent ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.16,0:11:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to be with me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:34.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get lost !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:49.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please spare my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.32,0:11:50.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please spare my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.60,0:11:54.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must act fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:55.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must act fast !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:57.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,If another Teng Family Member dies because of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:59.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,this will be bad !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:29.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spare Teng Xuan's life, we can discuss this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.24,0:12:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I destroyed the Spirit Vein.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:35.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old man Ji Mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:37.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you think this can be discussed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know where this Early stage Nascent Soul came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:41.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:42.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,fighting him isn't worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.51,0:12:45.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:46.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must not be aware
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:48.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,but there are 9 branches of Spirit Veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:51.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are all built by the Teng Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:54.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The one under the Tiandao Sect is just an auxilary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.72,0:12:56.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the Spirit Vein is destroyed, it can be rebuilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.68,0:12:58.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the dead cannot come back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:12:59.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:01.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,come with me to Teng Family City
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.24,0:13:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,and apologize to the Teng Patriarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.80,0:13:04.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this matter is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:07.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,It looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old man Ji Mo has been living
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,quite a good life lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:12.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.55,0:13:14.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,have we met before ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems that fellow cultivator is not from the country of Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.11,0:13:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhao is under the control of the Teng Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 9 Spirit Veins are not used by normal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:29.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,They nourish 9 powerful Nascent Soul Core Members !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:30.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,The other sects
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,have to rely on the Teng Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:35.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not to mention us rogue cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.16,0:13:37.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,9 Nascent Soul cultivators ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:39.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:41.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,For 200 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.56,0:13:43.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Teng Patriarch has been working hard
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.04,0:13:45.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,to build the Spirit Veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,He has nourished 9 Nascent Soul cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:51.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,to push the Teng Family to the number one spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the Teng Patriarch himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:57.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,is not someone you can offend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.64,0:13:59.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Listen to this old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.08,0:14:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Never, ever kill the Teng Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:12.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:15.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't know your place !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:18.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could've just apologized.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:21.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now, I can only take your head as compensation !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.56,0:14:53.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are just a lowly Early stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:56.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,yet you dare to act arrogantly in front of me !?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.28,0:15:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Slash !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:25.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:26.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's talk this out !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's talk this out !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:30.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know why I want to kill the Teng Family ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.35,0:15:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.44,0:15:36.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know what grudges you have with the Teng Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm just a Guest Elder serving the Teng.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.36,0:15:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,400 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:43.76,Sub,,0,0,0,, you had a disciple called Bai Zhan, I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:45.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you remember ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,He deserved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you paid and assassin
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,and caused a commotion in Teng Family City.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:55.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.88,0:15:59.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,so many people were killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:07.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,That Qi Condensation brat !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:19.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wanted to eat his Nascent Soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,But looking at the way Master is,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:24.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:28.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Huayuan...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:32.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you like those 9 Nascent Soul so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:34.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will kill them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.28,0:16:37.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:38.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will destroy them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:41.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:47.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want you to see your Teng Family
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:50.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,get wiped out !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:05.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.23,0:17:05.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.15,0:17:08.63,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:14.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:14.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:20.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.07,0:17:20.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.63,0:17:23.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.07,0:17:29.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:29.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:35.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:35.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:39.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:39.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.23,0:17:43.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:43.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.31,0:17:47.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:54.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:54.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:18:02.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.23,0:18:02.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.75,0:18:10.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.79,0:18:10.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.59,0:18:19.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:19.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:40.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.71,0:18:40.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:48.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.39,0:18:48.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.55,0:18:57.91,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.51,0:18:57.91,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.15,0:19:05.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:05.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
